CiukiOS Wine 10.0: fail TLS with ERROR_INTERNET_SECURITY_CHANNEL_ERROR.
LGPL-2.1-or-later. Plain HTTP and FTP retain the upstream Winsock paths.

--- a/dlls/wininet/netconnection.c
